  "text": "The Magister CAs\n\n​\nIntroduction\nThis guide will go over how to complete the Combat achievements for The Magister, and assumes you are already familiar with the basic mechanics of the encounter which can be found here #unknown-channel.\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Melee\n⬥ Ranged\n⬥ Necromancy\n\nThe Magister Master Speed Killer\n⬥ Defeat the Magister in less than 0:12.0\n⬥ You should NOT use these rotations for standard kills, only for the achievement.\n​\nMelee rotation\nWars:   → 120% adren\n​\n:  →  →  → build 8  stacks → wait  timer\n​\nStart fight + (tc) +  +  →  →  →  →   → \n​\nRanged rotation\n:   →  →  →  →  →   →   →  →   → \n​\nStart fight + (tc) +  +  →  →   +  →  \nNecromancy rotation\nBuild on Wars : 5  12 \n​\nPre-fight  →  →  →  → \n​\nStart fight + (tc) +  +  →   →  →   → \n​\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nExample Kills\n⬥ Melee\n⬥ Ranged\n⬥ Necromancy\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "The Magister CAs ​ Introduction This guide will go over how to complete the Combat achievements for The Magister, and assumes you are already familiar with the basic mechanics of the encounter which can be found here #unknown-channel. ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Melee ⬥ Ranged ⬥ Necromancy The Magister Master Speed Killer ⬥ Defeat the Magister in less than 0:12.0 ⬥ You should NOT use these rotations for standard kills, only for the achievement. ​ Melee rotation Wars: → 120% adren ​ : → → → build 8 stacks → wait timer ​ Start fight + (tc) + + → → → → → ​ Ranged rotation : → → → → → → → → → ​ Start fight + (tc) + + → → + → Necromancy rotation Build on Wars : 5 12 ​ Pre-fight → → → → ​ Start fight + (tc) + + → → → → ​ Example Kills ⬥ Melee ⬥ Ranged ⬥ Necromancy ​",
